    <briefdescription>
<para>Thread-safety guarantee for <ref refid="classthemis_1_1process_1_1_process_linker" kindref="compound">ProcessLinker</ref>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><bold>Pattern:</bold> FINE_GRAINED_LOCKING <linebreak/>
 <bold>Atomicity:</bold> SINGLE_ENTITY (one link at a time) <linebreak/>
 <bold>Conflict Resolution:</bold> LAST_WRITE_WINS (per-link version clock)</para>
<para>Linker uses per-link locking, allowing concurrent link operations on disjoint instances to proceed without blocking. Link-to-self updates are atomic.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="invariant"><para>Concurrent link operations on disjoint instances do not block. </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="invariant"><para>Per-link locking prevents write-write conflicts. </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="invariant"><para>Broken links (stale references) detected at read-time. </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="invariant"><para>No cascading deletes; manual remediation required. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
